From 6c556575eb3e1e2736536cf66a9c93438459f0d2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ksg <sisungaa851@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 17:12:59 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] Confirm conditions before routine generation and group plans
 by period

- Re-check the profile's goal and environment in a panel before every
  routine generation; confirmed values are saved to the exercise profile.
- Add optional focus regions (squat/hinge/push/pull/core): focused patterns
  lead each strength day and get one extra set unless volume is held.
- Add a plan period (one day, 1-12 weeks, 1-12 months) and group the
  routine page by month > week > day, opening the current week.
- Derive experience level on the profile from training history and recent
  weekly sessions; the routine panel only displays it.
- Replace fixed view-angle buttons in the exercise viewer with drag and
  45-degree rotate controls (character studio keeps its presets).
- Remove calorie and actual-time inputs after a workout, and keep the
  recovery stretches advancing when loading the next model stalls a frame.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
